Enable create flows: new project, new vendor, new task

Adds full CRUD modals where the buttons were previously stubbed:

- ProjectsList: مشروع جديد opens a modal with code/name/discipline/status/
  progress/budget/due-date/client/location plus a checkbox grid for team
  selection. Inserts into projects + project_team rows; the current user
  is added as PM automatically. Auto-suggests a code prefix per discipline
  (CIV/ELC/MEC/CON/MNT/TSV). Refetches list on success.
- Vendors: مورد جديد opens a modal with name/discipline/status/contact/
  notes. Inserts into vendors and refreshes the AppData context so the
  new vendor appears in expense/payment dropdowns immediately.
- ProjectDetail Tasks tab: adds مهمة جديدة header button + a delete
  button per row. Modal pre-fills the next sequential task code
  (PROJECT_CODE · T-NN) and lets you pick assignee from the project team.

New API:
- createProject (with project_team batch insert + PM auto-add)
- createVendor
- createTask, deleteTask, countProjectTasks

Validation in Arabic, error states styled with the danger-050/100 tokens.
RLS handles authorization server-side, so the buttons are visible to
admin/pm (projects, tasks) and admin/finance (vendors).
